config SOC_FAMILY_RPI_PICO_CPU1
	bool
	help
	  Hidden marker selected by every CPU1-side SoC variant. Used to
	  gate Kconfig options that are only meaningful in CPU0 images,
	  such as SOC_RPI_PICO_CPU1_ENABLE.
